    "title": "Olanzapine Versus Ziprasidone: Results of a 28-Week Double-Blind Study in Patients With Schizophrenia",
    "authors": "Alan Breier, M.D. Paul H. Berg, M.S. Jogin H. Thakore, M.D. Dieter Naber, M.D. Wagner F. Gattaz, M.D. Patrizia Cavazzoni, M.D. Daniel J. Walker, Ph.D. Suraja M. Roychowdhury, Ph.D. John M. Kane, M.D.",
